Package: pacose
Type: Package
Version: 3.0.0
Title: iPACOSE, PACOSE and other methods for covariance selection
Description: Estimation of partial correlation and precision matrices under
  graph-based conditional independence constraints. The package provides
  Ridge, PLS, LASSO, adaptive LASSO, iPACOSE, MVUE, SURE and INVEST methods.
